WEBVTT

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.620
Minos.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.500
What are you doing?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.420
Oh, hey, Yurine.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.250
I'm grilling lobsters.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.750
Ta-da!

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.510
I think those are crawfi--

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.300
When I told Jashin-chan

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:24.930
I wanted to try lobster...

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.680
Big catch at Shimizu Canal
around the corner!

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.730
And then she gave me all this!

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.940
A BUNCH

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.810
-Want some?
-No.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.400
-I'll grill some.
-No, thanks.

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:40.440
Looking good!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:43.110
Let's try it.
Ouch! It's hot.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.370
There. Let's eat!

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.330
Amazing! Nothing beats lobster!

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.710
100% BEEF

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.040
-Crawfish is good?
-Try some, Yurine!

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.710
-No, thanks.
-It's so crunchy.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.300
Pretty darn good!

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.260
Won’t leave

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:12.060
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.230
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:33.210
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.750
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.630
-I can’t go back to Hell!
-Sister...

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.340
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.260
If you go too far,

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:47.260
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:49.510
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:53.640
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:57.850
-To attack her from behind!
-You’re so mean.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:02.110
I’ll never give up.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.740
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.910
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.830
Huh? What? I missed…

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.250
Can’t leave Earth

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:19.380
without a dropkick on her!

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.550
But until then,

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:28.470
-let’s all have fun together!
-Yeah!

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.320
What about my present?

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.990
Of course I'll buy you one.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.120
Really? Thanks!

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:53.540
That's right.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.410
It's Christmas.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.420
I'm so hungry.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:08.930
It's Christmas.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.970
And I'm having bread crust.

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.930
My Lord endured hardships too.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.690
I should be grateful for the food I have!

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.450
-It's cold.
-So, what do you want for Christmas?

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.370
I want wealth, honor and status.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.580
That's pretty mature of you.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.540
I'm sure Santa will make it happen.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.250
Then, I want love.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.590
-Whoa, that's so cool.
-Right?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.340
I want love.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.380
So cool.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:50.760
Santa? Must be talking about
Saint Nicholas.

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.800
He's got a lot on his plate.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.220
How will he fulfill
these kids' wishes?

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.850
I wish for something
with bold flavor.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.770
Why am I wishing
for a Christmas present

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.810
when I'm not even human!?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:11.070
To begin with,
Christmas isn't even about presents!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:17.870
Shoot, I'm choking!
I need something to drink!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.960
MILK

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.500
That was close.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.130
I almost drank it all.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:30.010
This is all I have for today.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:34.010
I'm grateful for the food I have.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.770
But I'm craving something with more flavor.
Like curry.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.060
Santa, will you visit an angel?

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.980
Delicious.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.530
This smell...

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:50.780
So good.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.780
-Curry?
-This curry is amazing.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.030
Yurine Hanazono's familiar spirit.
Why is she here?

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.790
Wait, that hat.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.330
-Is she Saint Nicholas' spirit?
-I got the take-out deal.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.330
-So good!
-Was she sent for me?

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:10.050
-It was so good, I devoured it all.
-Nope.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.800
I'll eat the second one too.

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:15.930
It smells wonderful!

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:18.430
Curry...

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.480
So juicy!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.440
Juicy...

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.230
What are you staring at?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.230
-None for you.
-I couldn't help it.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:32.940
How embarrassing.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.700
-I want that.
-Huh?

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:45.460
Give it to me.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.290
You just had a feast.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.500
This is all I have.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.260
I finished my food, so give me that.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.550
You glutton. You'll end up in Hell.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.600
Funny. I'm from there.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:03.980
I don't care. I'm still hungry!

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:08.230
-Stop! This is all I have!
-Shut up! Give it to me!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.570
M-My precious milk!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.610
Your back's wide open!

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.950
Merry Christmas!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.330
-Thanks.
-No!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:31.250
Delicious! Stolen food
is out-of-this-world good.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.340
It's a bit dry,
but delicious nonetheless.

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.590
H-How cruel.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.760
You're the one who turned
your back on me.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.140
And thanks for the compliment.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.720
Give me back my precious food!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:49.310
I'm not scared of you,
halo-less angel!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.360
What the hell are you doing?

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:52.820
Ah! Yurine...

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.860
I told you to go home with the curry
while I got the chicken.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.450
The witch, Yurine Hanazono.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.580
-I don't know.
-Huh? What?

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.330
I don't know.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.620
You ate the curry?

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.830
I-I don't know!

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.000
-Both of them?
-I don't know anything.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.590
Where am I? Who am I?

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.010
I don't know.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.640
-She ate it!
-What?

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.560
She's tiny, but she can eat.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:27.480
-I told her no, but...
-Jashin-chan.

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.100
Why lie about it?

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.360
Fine, I ate it!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.480
So?

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.120
Unbelievable.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:52.130
-As punishment, no chicken for you.
-Oh come on...

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.960
T-Takoyaki... Blood...

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.050
-T-Takoyaki...
-Pekola.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:03.550
Jashin-chan gave you a lot of trouble.

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.760
Please accept my apologies.

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.770
This is Jashin-chan's chicken.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.730
Food with bold flavor!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.690
I-I can't accept anything
from a witch.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.440
No way!

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.070
I'm still an angel, you know?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.620
You could've poisoned it too.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.870
This is an apology, accept it.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.580
To eat it or not is your choice.

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.630
Jashin-chan, we're going home.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:41.050
It's time to decorate our place.
Wanna be the tree?

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.140
Chicken! With bold flavors.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.850
Yurine Hanazono.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:58.780
-You're a witch, but my Santa!
-Why don't I gift your meat to Beth?

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.490
Please don't...

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:07.330
You like it, huh?
Eat as much as you want.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.870
Jashin-chan, do you know?

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.130
Why Santa's outfit is red?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.840
It's because it's stained in blood.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.630
Merry Christmas.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:29.010
Merry Christmas-sacre! Huh?

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.690
Jashin-chan, where are you?

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:40.270
Jashin-chan... Jashin-chan...

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:44.900
-Jashin-chan... Jashin-chan...
-She's hopeless on the streets.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:49.660
-Jashin-chan... Jashin-chan...
-Will she ever find her?

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.870
I'm right here, getting crucified.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.420
The seasons change
in a blink of an eye.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.920
It's now deep autumn.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:16.140
Done with training.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:19.400
My own breathing method
is doing me great.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.650
These abs will make my dropkick
more lethal.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.950
Yurine, punch me in the stomach.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.030
Test out these abs of steel.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.290
All right.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.540
Damn it.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.000
Jashin-chan?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.010
Coming!

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:51.180
Hello, my name is Yusa.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.930
Thank you for taking care
of my sister.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.430
Yusa? Um...

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.440
Enjoy.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.230
Thank you.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.940
I planned on eating this cake
all by myself!

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:08.570
REGAINED CONSCIOUSNESS

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:12.330
Should've had it before my training!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:20.000
Kori-chan saved us
during the summer.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:27.170
But could you please stop the blizzard?
It's freezing.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.050
Oh, of course.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:34.890
I know you two are sisters,

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.600
but are you even the same organism?

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.350
Yes.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:44.070
We, Ice Devils, change appearances
as we grow.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:47.900
We're born with certain abilities
as a child.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:51.570
But when we mature,
like I did,

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:55.370
we receive a name and become
a full-fledged devil.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:12:01.250
In human years, Ice Devils mature
at around 15 years old.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.670
I see.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.840
May I suggest Kori-chan's
future name?

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.470
How about Koji?

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.720
YUSA
KOJI

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:17.350
Isn't that a boy's name?

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.100
I guess so.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.600
Koji?

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.400
So, what brings you here today?

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:27.480
Yes, we didn't mean to show up
unannounced,

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.950
but my sister begged me
to take her to see you.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.110
We brought this for you.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:40.120
-I heard she had fun with her.
-Damn it! Such a thin slice.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.330
So, I wanted to thank her too.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:50.970
Why the hell is she glaring
at me like she wants to kill me?

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:54.140
Is she actually here to kill me?

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:57.850
Mature Ice Devils
are high-class devils.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:00.890
She could kill me in a second!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.140
DEFEATIST WHEN FACING
STRONG DEVILS

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:05.350
Jashin-chan, did you do something?

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:13.110
She whistled in your ear
just to mess with you?

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:17.120
-You're only 95 yen.
-She stuck a bread-price tag on you?

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.790
Koji! You snitch!

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.410
You're such an idiot.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:26.960
Now she's traumatized
with the sound of the whistle.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.590
And she can't even step inside
a grocery store anymore.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:31.920
That's ridiculous!

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:36.800
She's the low-class devil
who disobeyed me!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.640
You insulted her again.

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:44.980
When you insult her, you insult our proud family.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.980
What proud family?

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.400
You have the face of a mole.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.440
What's there to be proud of?

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.280
A mole?

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.950
Did you just call her a mole?

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:00.870
I planned on leaving peacefully today.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.080
But now, you’ve said it.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.250
You said the last thing
an Ice Devil wants to hear.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:09.170
What? Just go home, will ya?

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.210
It's freezing in here!

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:16.180
Koji's a piece of cake, but her?
Forget about it.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:19.720
What do I do?
Think of something quick!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.930
There must be an effective way...

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.850
Oh, yeah!

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.230
What the hell is that?

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:28.940
Idiot! It's nothing!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.940
You're done, Koji!
Face your back at me like that!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:37.490
I'll pierce you with a dropkick
now enhanced with my abs of steel!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:41.620
Killing you in front of your sister
will devastate her.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:44.000
She'll be too unstable to fight.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.410
And best of all, I'll win!

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.000
Let's not forget...!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.010
Jeez, not again.

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:06.770
My abs of steel
were completely useless.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.870
Do you think you can
let Jashin-chan go for today?

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:28.000
Sure. And I'm so glad my sister
got to see you, Yurine.

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:41.260
I got the slice to stand upright!
Hell, yeah!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:44.010
It stands! It stands! It stands!

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:48.730
HELL BANK
JINBOCHO BRANCH

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:51.650
Here, I brought the money.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.650
Can't you be discreet?

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.270
I don't want Yurine to know!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:56.730
S-Sorry.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.360
Too late now.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.280
Sponging off Medusa again?

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.160
N-Not at all.

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:06.080
She's just paying me back.

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:08.040
You're the lowest of the low.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.040
She knows.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:13.880
I-I'm just borrowing it.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.420
I always pay her back.

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:20.840
I paid her back the 40 yen
I borrowed 100 years ago.

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:24.510
That's the initial salary
of 100 years ago.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:28.350
I don't really need her
to pay me back.

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:33.730
Right? It's best to assume the money
you lend will never come back.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.270
You have no right to say that.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.360
Medusa, you're spoiling her
a bit too much.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:44.030
You're enabling her
to be a scumbag.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:47.790
A scumbag? No, that's not good!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.910
Right? So, you have to be responsible with her.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.040
What, Medusa?

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.460
You're gonna listen to her?

00:16:56.670 --> 00:17:00.800
You've known me for thousands
of years and yet, you choose Yurine?

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.300
U-Um...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.510
You traitor!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.800
Ah, here we go again.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.350
I-It's not like that.
I'm just concerned for you.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.560
Liar!

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:15.770
You just like yourself acting
like a goody two-shoes!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.700
I hate you, Jashin-chan!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.700
I don't care about you anymore.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:33.620
I'm never coming back
to the human world again!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.960
I don't need you!
Don't ever come back!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:50.470
I said a bit too much.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:53.480
Medusa...

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:58.360
Medusa hates me now.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.780
Medusa was, to me...

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:05.200
She was my precious...

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.740
Precious...

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:11.740
-Personal ATM.
-I knew that was coming.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.920
Say cheese!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:25.340
I highly recommend
the cheesy pizza toast. It's tasty!

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:32.770
Can't go on without a drink!

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:36.600
She said she's never coming back.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:40.730
Now I gotta make her send the money
via Hell-registered mail.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:45.240
I don't need to see her face.

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:50.280
Another fresh strawberry juice
please!

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.950
You're drinking too much.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.330
Leave me alone.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:59.210
Having too much strawberry juice
won't kill me.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:01.880
I'm not concerned about you.

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:05.420
We don't want to run out
for the other customers.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:08.300
Oh.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.020
I can't even get myself to walk.

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.700
This is so sad!

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.030
Medusa left me.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.330
And nobody cares about me!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:35.490
I...

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.040
I...

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:42.630
Did I do something that bad?
Maybe I did, but still!

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:48.050
Come on, can't you just love me
for who I am?

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:53.100
Come on! Just love me, please!

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:55.720
-Love me for who I am!
-What's wrong with you?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:59.770
What's wrong with me?

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.230
Take me away.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.110
I'm lonely!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.570
Calm down, will ya?

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:07.070
Jashin-chan?

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:10.530
I'm hearing voices now.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.280
I've lost my mind.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:13.740
Jashin-chan.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.580
Medusa's voice.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:21.790
I didn't lose my mind.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.630
I came to pick you up.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:29.090
Y-You came back to me,
my ATM!

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:34.010
Medusa was so worried,
she came right back.

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.220
A... T...

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:40.350
It was all my fault
Forgive me, AT--

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.940
No, Medusa!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.520
I know, Jashin-chan.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:48.480
You can't function without me.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:52.030
I love you, Medusa.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:55.450
At... the... moment...

00:20:56.780 --> 00:21:00.250
I love you at the moment, Medusa!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.670
At the moment!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.250
ATM!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:13.220
ATM! ATM! ATM!

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:19.260
ATM! ATM! ATM!

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:25.600
Jashin-chan, aren't you hungry?

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.400
Let's get some curry.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:30.110
What happened?

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:35.030
I'm completely broke because I had
100 glasses of strawberry juice.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:40.910
Don't worry,
I'll take care of the bill.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:46.580
I just can't live without you,
Medusa.

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:50.380
I love you, Medusa!

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:55.180
I'll never leave you again,
Jashin-chan.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.890
-Medusa just enabled her to become
-Where should we go?

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:01.310
-the ultra-scumbag.
-Bondy, of course!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.730
-Let's go!
-Yay!

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.020
SCUMBAG

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:08.440
-Medusa.
-Jashin-chan.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:34.720
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:39.470
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:44.810
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:48.900
As she starves to death!

00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:51.860
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.190
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:58.860
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:59.070 --> 00:23:03.080
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:05.330
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:12.540
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:16.800
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.050 --> 00:23:21.050
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:23.390
When all is said and done

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:28.190
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:32.900
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:35.110
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:38.700
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.780 --> 00:23:43.830
There's a lady enticing the devil.

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:46.160
Love and hate are
two sides of the same coin.

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:50.120
So with her pure love, she tries to kill the devil.

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:55.210
Dropkick on My Devil!
We'll backdrop your heart in the next episode too!
